        </tei:div>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/fourth_day/nafshi_nivhalah">
          <tei:pb n="35" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n72_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>My soul is sore vexed, but thou, O Lord, how long? O Lord, how long shall the wicked—how long shall the wicked triumph. O God, how long shall the adversary reproach? shall the enemy blaspheme thy name for ever? O Lord, hear our voices, let thine ears be attentive to the voice of our supplication. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/fourth_day/verses_instruction">
